        "original_id": "e5b112e9-ad7e-5f0c-ba93-fe8e685a166c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: CityJet, Air France, KLM, Brussels Airlines, Scandinavian Airlines\n- Places: Charles de Gaulle Airport, Montparnasse, Paris\n- Topics: wet-lease agreements, corporate headquarters\n\nFacts:\n- CityJet serves several additional destinations through wet-lease agreements with Air France, KLM, Brussels Airlines, and Scandinavian Airlines.\n- CityJet's wet-lease agreement with Air France ends on 31 October 2017.\n- Air France's corporate headquarters were previously in Montparnasse, Paris.\n- Air France's corporate headquarters are located on the grounds of Charles de Gaulle Airport north of Paris.",
